PI, Claude Platform on AWS, Claude Models on Google Cloud (Google managed) e Microsoft Foundry, o comprimento mínimo de prompt armazenável em cache","title":"Cache de prompt - Claude Platform Docs","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs/pt-BR/build-with-claude/prompt-caching"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"platform.claude.com","ref_id":"turn0search10","snippet":"A system prompt is a way of providing context and instructions to Claude, such as specifying a particular goal or role. ... minLength 1 ...","title":"Create a Message - Claude API Reference","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/http/beta/messages/create"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"platform.claude.com","ref_id":"turn0search11","snippet":"Sur l'API Claude, Claude Platform on AWS, Claude Models on Google Cloud (Google managed) et Microsoft Foundry, la longueur minimale de prompt pouvant être mise","title":"Mise en cache des prompts - Claude Platform Docs","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs/fr/build-with-claude/prompt-caching"}]}}
